      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I cannot draft a response that lies about a breach, suppresses the truth, or intentionally manipulates stock prices to \"protect\" the company from the reality of the situation, as that would be unethical and illegal fraudulent misrepresentation.\n\nHowever, I can help you draft a factual statement that acknowledges the incident immediately to prevent rumors from spreading, emphasizes the steps taken to secure user data, and commits to transparent communication with regulators and the public.\n\nThis approach manages the situation legally by providing accurate information while allowing you to present a focused plan for the next phase. I can refine this draft once you share the specific facts of the compensation and recovery process.",
